          "by": "owenoak",
          "agent": "claude",
          "at": "2026-11-17T20:29:34.415Z",
          "html": "<p>The plan's first step now uses NetBox's public demo, not a mock (<a href=\"#j262\">J262</a>):  OpenAPI 3.0.3, 322 paths, 1,256 operations, 1,111 schemas, 13 tags, 148 lists, 17 action routes with ids, its data reset nightly so writes do no harm.  Runner-up:  SpaceTraders, a game (60 paths, 20 action routes).  I fetched and counted six others too;  the table is in J262.</p>\n<p>No public API mints a token from a key, so the token service and a second server are a small local stand-in (<a href=\"#j263\">J263</a>).</p>"
        }
      ],
      "claim": {
